[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4514.99, "timestamp": "01:15:14", "text": "自从我们第一次交谈以来，你就一直是个异类。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4524.07, "timestamp": "01:15:24", "text": "不用担心。返校课程面向所有入学学生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4526.629, "timestamp": "01:15:26", "text": "揭露人们试图忽视的过去和真实感受。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4528.629, "timestamp": "01:15:28", "text": "我知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4554.39, "timestamp": "01:15:54", "text": "20"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4556.877, "timestamp": "01:15:56", "text": "在我十岁之前，我就凭借自己的能力阅读了唱片。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4558.35, "timestamp": "01:15:58", "text": "[音乐]"}]